"Nachricht zu schreiben. Deshalb bauen wir eine Plattform, die Kunden und "
"Fahrer fair und transparent zusammenbringt."
msgstr ""
"We believe that sending something should be as easy as writing a message. "
"That's why we build a platform that brings customers and drivers together "
"fairly and transparently."

